          "description": "Familiar nursery rhymes get delightfully mixed up in this silly, surprising sing-along collection.\n\nPre-School Remixed brings together familiar favourites in playful new combinations, including ‘Twinkle Twinkle Little Lamb’, ‘Baa Baa Black Sheep on the Bus’ and ‘Old MacDonald’s Picnic’. Packed with catchy tunes, silly surprises and plenty of chances to sing along, it’s perfect for listeners who love music, movement and fun.\n\nVocals Ulrika Bergelind/Ben Cullum\nWritten by Ben Cullum/Joey Swarbrick\nMusic Produced/Mixed/Mastered by Ben Cullum",
          "abridged": false,
          "audioPreviewUrl": "https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/audio-previews/1b1131905d998c7e167e6f245e007ecbcfa0a8c88ec30ad8016e4a5962aea9d4/GcnAJYqylrBeofRTV-wSkuTlFk0ShBO-BmC8sW9rMEg.mp3",
